---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="East Coast Foam — LDW Demo" description="Private East Coast Foam website concepts by Lowcountry Digital Works.">
  <main class="chooser" id="top">
    <div class="chooser__inner">
      <p class="eyebrow">Lowcountry Digital Works · private concept environment</p>
      <h1>Two paths for East Coast Foam.</h1>
      <p class="chooser__intro">The same business information powers both demos. Classical prioritizes a low-risk replacement of today's site. Future shows what the experience can become.</p>
      <div class="chooser-grid">
        <a class="chooser-card chooser-card--classical" href="/classical">
          <span>01</span>
          <h2>Classical</h2>
          <p>Familiar structure, familiar green/black identity, cleaner implementation, easier future cutover.</p>
          <strong>Open Classical →</strong>
        </a>
        <a class="chooser-card chooser-card--future" href="/future">
          <span>02</span>
          <h2>Modern / Future</h2>
          <p>A new sales experience built around local trust, better estimate intake, recent work, and future automation.</p>
          <strong>Open Future →</strong>
        </a>
      </div>
      <p class="chooser-footnote">No changes have been made to the production GoDaddy/WordPress site or DNS.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
